WEBVTT

01:37.610 --> 01:42.920
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.340 --> 01:46.039
[Episode 17]

01:52.070 --> 01:53.590
So this is the wish-granting tree

01:53.590 --> 01:54.590
you told me about?

01:58.470 --> 01:59.200
Wait here.

02:03.000 --> 02:05.280
Sir, one wishing plaque, please.

02:05.510 --> 02:06.150
Thank you.

02:11.120 --> 02:11.960
Make a wish.

02:32.030 --> 02:32.890
Your Lordship,

02:33.190 --> 02:34.390
what did you wish for?

02:35.120 --> 02:36.920
Whether my wish comes true or not

02:37.000 --> 02:38.070
doesn't depend on the will of Heaven,

02:38.070 --> 02:39.270
but solely on myself.

02:42.310 --> 02:43.430
So this wish of mine

02:44.840 --> 02:46.030
is for you.

02:49.190 --> 02:50.520
I wish you

02:50.680 --> 02:52.140
auspiciousness every day

02:52.400 --> 02:54.329
and that all your wishes come true.

03:19.470 --> 03:20.590
Shen Run,

03:21.150 --> 03:22.600
I saw you in him

03:23.000 --> 03:24.360
once again.

03:25.070 --> 03:28.360
Now, I can no longer tell
the difference between you two.

03:29.680 --> 03:31.280
Is he the person I'm missing?

03:32.360 --> 03:34.760
Perhaps you two
really are the same person.

03:43.150 --> 03:43.960
It's said that

03:44.750 --> 03:47.870
Lord Yan Rui from the capital

03:48.870 --> 03:50.680
has swift and decisive methods

03:51.030 --> 03:53.050
and a heart of steel.

03:53.430 --> 03:54.800
He kills corrupt officials,

03:54.800 --> 03:55.930
suppresses famine,

03:56.240 --> 03:57.910
and exterminates northern bandits.

03:57.910 --> 03:59.680
The whole nation is shocked,

04:00.240 --> 04:02.240
and the people praise him.

04:02.400 --> 04:03.680
Great!

04:08.030 --> 04:09.080
But everyone,

04:09.430 --> 04:10.840
do you really think

04:11.240 --> 04:13.470
he is a court official?

04:16.750 --> 04:18.070
An informant

04:18.310 --> 04:19.720
has brought news.

04:20.720 --> 04:21.990
That Lord Yan

04:22.510 --> 04:24.190
isn't even surnamed Yan!

04:25.000 --> 04:26.240
He's a

04:26.510 --> 04:28.630
fake!

04:28.920 --> 04:30.000
A fake?

04:30.030 --> 04:31.030
He's a fake.

04:31.050 --> 04:31.750
A fake?

04:36.070 --> 04:36.630
My Lady.

04:37.510 --> 04:39.000
Lord Yan asked me to tell you

04:39.000 --> 04:39.970
that Cui is fine now

04:39.970 --> 04:41.510
and will be released from prison soon.

04:41.510 --> 04:42.430
Okay, got it.

04:44.510 --> 04:45.270
Did you hear?

04:45.920 --> 04:47.680
That Lord Yan,
who provided disaster relief,

04:47.680 --> 04:48.630
is a fake.

04:49.560 --> 04:50.240
What?

04:50.800 --> 04:52.240
Impersonating a court official

04:52.240 --> 04:53.840
is a capital offense!

04:54.120 --> 04:54.920
Keep your voice down.

04:54.920 --> 04:55.800
People are watching.

04:55.800 --> 04:58.000
The real Lord Yan is already dead.

04:58.950 --> 05:00.360
This person right now

05:00.800 --> 05:02.430
is just a mere commoner

05:02.430 --> 05:03.750
who borrowed the identity,

05:03.750 --> 05:04.800
took the title,

05:04.800 --> 05:06.200
and transformed himself

05:06.240 --> 05:09.240
into a great official!

05:12.070 --> 05:13.650
Is that so?

05:13.870 --> 05:15.480
You ask who he is?

05:16.190 --> 05:18.070
It's scary to say.

05:18.270 --> 05:20.720
This person walks the dark path

05:21.000 --> 05:22.430
and talks about rules.

05:22.870 --> 05:23.950
His sword never leaves his side.

05:23.950 --> 05:26.270
When unsheathed, it must see blood.

05:26.800 --> 05:27.630
Legend has it

05:27.800 --> 05:29.190
that in one night,

05:29.310 --> 05:31.720
he beheaded 17 people.

05:32.000 --> 05:33.120
No one has seen him

05:34.000 --> 05:35.680
strike a second time.

05:35.950 --> 05:37.560
Now you know

05:37.750 --> 05:39.800
why he comes from
a civil official background,

05:39.800 --> 05:43.430
but can brave the northern bandits.

05:43.600 --> 05:44.270
What?

05:44.430 --> 05:45.960
So he's a bandit.

05:46.150 --> 05:48.630
No wonder he acts so unconventionally.

05:48.950 --> 05:50.080
So what if he is fake?

05:50.510 --> 05:52.270
We still like him even if he is fake.

05:52.270 --> 05:54.120
He works for us common people.

05:54.120 --> 05:54.610
Yes.

05:54.630 --> 05:54.920
Yes.

05:54.950 --> 05:57.350
What?
Are we not allowed to speak our minds?

05:58.720 --> 06:00.750
Between true and false,

06:01.000 --> 06:03.040
it's hard to tell loyalty from treason.

06:03.040 --> 06:05.750
Listen to me tell you

06:06.680 --> 06:07.630
the details.

06:10.270 --> 06:11.950
In just one night,

06:11.950 --> 06:14.010
the rumors about Lord Yan's identity

06:14.240 --> 06:15.970
have spread all over Hengtang.

06:17.430 --> 06:19.090
Qingyuan, if you are worried,

06:19.270 --> 06:20.600
why don't you go see him?

06:26.480 --> 06:27.560
I heard

06:28.000 --> 06:29.730
Concubine Mei is not doing well

06:30.070 --> 06:32.200
and might be sent out of the residence.

06:33.360 --> 06:34.680
She deserves it.

07:07.510 --> 07:08.480
Fourth Lady.

07:10.190 --> 07:11.560
The case is settled.

07:11.920 --> 07:12.920
You can leave now.

07:14.160 --> 07:14.750
Yes.

07:16.160 --> 07:18.090
Have you thought about where to go?

07:20.870 --> 07:22.040
Can someone like me

07:23.390 --> 07:25.040
still choose my own future?

07:28.570 --> 07:29.300
Yes, you can.

07:30.190 --> 07:32.120
I can arrange a new identity for you

07:33.430 --> 07:35.560
and give you some money to settle down.

07:35.680 --> 07:37.240
You can go anywhere,

07:38.070 --> 07:39.360
choose to get married,

07:40.000 --> 07:41.460
or start a small business.

07:42.310 --> 07:43.040
You can live

07:43.060 --> 07:44.820
any kind of life you want.

07:45.150 --> 07:46.280
No one will know you.

07:53.870 --> 07:55.310
What do you need me to do?

07:58.800 --> 08:00.800
You don't need to do anything for me.

08:06.120 --> 08:06.720
Do you

08:07.310 --> 08:08.240
not hate me?

08:11.160 --> 08:12.680
You were just a pawn.

08:14.160 --> 08:15.360
Even without you,

08:16.560 --> 08:18.160
there would be someone else.

08:22.270 --> 08:23.040
Cui'er,

08:23.920 --> 08:25.160
live your life well.

08:25.950 --> 08:27.410
When you have the ability,

08:27.950 --> 08:29.190
help those around you

08:29.870 --> 08:32.130
so they can also have the right to choose.

08:33.120 --> 08:35.179
That would be the best way to repay me.

08:41.720 --> 08:42.669
Thank you.

09:12.600 --> 09:13.320
Baoxian.

09:17.480 --> 09:18.030
Baoxian.

09:21.720 --> 09:22.650
She fell asleep.

09:31.360 --> 09:32.750
Isn't Lord Yan with you?

09:33.890 --> 09:35.820
I'm here precisely because of him.

09:36.390 --> 09:37.480
Do you know

09:37.720 --> 09:39.120
he bears heavy responsibilities?

09:37.760 --> 09:40.850
[Danyue Pavilion]

09:39.550 --> 09:40.680
Now, because of you,

09:40.960 --> 09:42.030
he is distracted

09:42.750 --> 09:44.610
and delaying important matters.

09:44.870 --> 09:46.150
If you know him,

09:46.510 --> 09:47.640
you should know that

09:47.870 --> 09:49.270
once he makes up his mind,

09:49.360 --> 09:50.440
no one can sway him.

09:50.840 --> 09:52.900
It's impossible
for me to change him.

09:53.270 --> 09:54.360
This path

09:54.480 --> 09:56.440
guarantees certain death.

09:56.960 --> 09:58.510
Any slight distraction

09:58.910 --> 10:00.670
will make him fail completely.

10:01.080 --> 10:03.440
So having you by his side

10:03.910 --> 10:05.710
is a disaster waiting to happen.

10:11.540 --> 10:12.600
[Danyue Pavilion]

10:12.080 --> 10:12.670
Che.

10:14.360 --> 10:15.240
Step aside!

10:15.670 --> 10:17.720
If you still remember your family name,

10:17.720 --> 10:19.450
let me get rid of this disaster!

10:19.550 --> 10:20.870
For what we need to do,

10:20.870 --> 10:22.000
what good does it do?

10:22.120 --> 10:23.320
If it reminds you

10:23.630 --> 10:25.490
of our family's deep grievances,

10:25.720 --> 10:27.540
her death won't be in vain!

10:33.140 --> 10:34.470
[Danyue Pavilion]

10:40.080 --> 10:40.720
Che.

10:41.440 --> 10:42.960
I have never forgotten.

10:43.480 --> 10:44.550
For so many years,

10:45.240 --> 10:46.900
I lived like a walking corpse.

10:47.480 --> 10:48.870
Only when I am by her side

10:49.720 --> 10:51.120
do I feel alive.

10:53.560 --> 10:55.990
[Danyue Pavilion]

10:56.270 --> 10:57.910
You only have one life.

10:58.790 --> 11:00.450
You have a mission to fulfill.

11:00.510 --> 11:03.150
The sword in your hand
cannot rust because of feelings.

11:03.150 --> 11:04.480
Think it through.

11:17.360 --> 11:18.090
Are you okay?

11:19.270 --> 11:20.080
I'm fine.

11:21.080 --> 11:21.840
Who is he?

11:22.630 --> 11:25.490
And what are the deep grievances
he just mentioned?

11:27.630 --> 11:28.830
Living in this world,

11:29.270 --> 11:31.270
it's inevitable to have some feuds.

11:34.630 --> 11:36.670
He and I walked out of the same hell.

11:37.670 --> 11:39.270
We bear the same blood debts.

11:40.200 --> 11:41.000
It's just that

11:42.080 --> 11:43.480
he suffers more than I do.

12:13.440 --> 12:15.640
Yan Rui thinks I'm acting out of hatred,

12:16.590 --> 12:18.320
hating him for falling in love.

12:19.240 --> 12:19.960
No.

12:20.550 --> 12:21.360
He is wrong.

12:23.360 --> 12:25.560
What I fear is not Xie Qingyuan herself,

12:26.840 --> 12:29.770
but the people possibly
pulling strings behind her.

12:30.510 --> 12:32.770
The Xie family knows too well how to kill.

12:32.840 --> 12:34.500
What if they don't use blades,

12:34.630 --> 12:35.790
but tenderness?

12:36.630 --> 12:39.080
You can't gamble your life
on a moment of weakness.

12:39.080 --> 12:41.240
Xie Qingyuan might be innocent,

12:41.750 --> 12:43.200
but what I must do

12:42.270 --> 12:49.680
[Frugality Cultivates Virtue]

12:43.440 --> 12:44.970
cannot risk any "what-ifs"

12:45.120 --> 12:46.510
and "perhaps."

12:47.120 --> 12:49.150
I'm not killing your beloved.

12:49.600 --> 12:51.320
I'm just eliminating every

12:51.320 --> 12:53.380
possibility that could destroy you.

13:04.390 --> 13:05.080
Che.

13:05.510 --> 13:06.840
What are you doing here?

13:07.670 --> 13:09.400
Do you know how agonizing it was

13:09.870 --> 13:11.840
to lie under Mother's dead body,

13:12.960 --> 13:14.360
and feel her body

13:15.360 --> 13:16.720
turn cold

13:18.000 --> 13:19.000
bit by bit?

13:20.390 --> 13:21.670
Do you know that

13:22.200 --> 13:24.260
I crawled out of a pile of dead bodies?

13:25.960 --> 13:28.840
I faced that dead silence for so long.

13:30.390 --> 13:31.320
Those people

13:32.080 --> 13:34.240
were all our family.

13:43.670 --> 13:44.790
You don't know.

13:46.000 --> 13:46.790
That's why,

13:47.670 --> 13:49.440
for your own selfish feelings,

13:50.840 --> 13:51.440
you forgot

13:52.750 --> 13:54.880
the responsibility on our shoulders.

14:04.030 --> 14:04.790
Che.

14:06.080 --> 14:08.340
I really thought you were dead back then.

14:10.910 --> 14:12.670
Until I saw you again later,

14:15.960 --> 14:18.090
I didn't know you had suffered so much.

14:19.840 --> 14:20.600
Yes.

14:24.000 --> 14:25.670
I've fallen for Qingyuan.

14:28.550 --> 14:30.010
If hatred is involuntary,

14:30.150 --> 14:31.080
what about love?

14:32.480 --> 14:34.120
Can I control love?

14:38.440 --> 14:39.440
But I know

14:41.510 --> 14:42.910
I can control my own life.

14:47.270 --> 14:49.200
My life is tied to yours.

14:50.840 --> 14:53.240
Before our father's name is cleared,

14:54.630 --> 14:57.120
and before our enemies pay in blood,

14:59.870 --> 15:01.240
I will never waver.

15:16.750 --> 15:17.910
I just hope...

15:19.670 --> 15:22.200
I just hope that
after we resolve everything,

15:24.270 --> 15:25.530
we can let go of the past

15:27.750 --> 15:28.880
and live a good life.

15:40.870 --> 15:42.120
Somebody...

15:46.270 --> 15:47.510
Somebody!

15:50.030 --> 15:50.840
Second Madam,

15:51.390 --> 15:52.850
it is time for you to leave.

15:53.630 --> 15:54.750
Where am I going?

15:55.790 --> 15:57.480
On the orders of the Head Madam,

15:57.480 --> 15:59.030
I am to take you to the estate

15:59.440 --> 16:00.960
to pray for the Old Madam.

16:04.630 --> 16:06.150
I am not going.

16:08.510 --> 16:10.570
Since marrying into this residence,

16:11.240 --> 16:13.630
I never planned to leave this house.

16:16.030 --> 16:18.030
I'm not going anywhere.

16:18.910 --> 16:20.480
I almost forgot.

16:21.440 --> 16:22.670
Eldest Young Master

16:23.790 --> 16:24.870
has sent a letter.

16:28.510 --> 16:30.080
Give my son's letter

16:30.870 --> 16:31.840
to me.

16:32.070 --> 16:34.100
[Respectfully to Madam Mei of the Xie
family in Hengtang, from Xie Zhenglun]

16:32.240 --> 16:34.150
After committing such a grave mistake,

16:34.150 --> 16:37.390
you don't deserve to read the letter
from a Xie family descendant.

16:37.390 --> 16:38.910
You lowly maidservant!

16:41.600 --> 16:42.790
From now on,

16:42.840 --> 16:46.550
-the Eldest and Second Young Master
-Give me the letter.

16:47.840 --> 16:50.500
will be registered
under the Head Madam's name.

16:51.390 --> 16:52.150
Take her away.

16:52.150 --> 16:52.480
Yes.

16:52.480 --> 16:53.870
You lowly maidservant!

16:54.240 --> 16:55.750
Give me the letter!

16:56.000 --> 16:56.910
Stop!

16:56.910 --> 16:58.000
What are you doing?

16:58.120 --> 16:59.150
Second Young Master.

16:59.150 --> 16:59.610
Mother.

17:00.360 --> 17:00.910
Mother!

17:03.960 --> 17:04.510
Get lost!

17:08.550 --> 17:09.480
Zhengjun.

17:09.790 --> 17:10.349
Mother.

17:10.750 --> 17:12.270
Help me.

17:14.400 --> 17:16.200
Your brother sent a letter.

17:18.030 --> 17:19.680
When he left,

17:20.960 --> 17:23.069
I couldn't even see him off.

17:25.310 --> 17:30.110
I want to see
what he said to me in the letter.

17:31.440 --> 17:33.720
-Mother.
-Help me.

17:34.030 --> 17:34.510
Okay.

17:34.920 --> 17:35.270
Okay.

17:35.480 --> 17:37.440
Mother, don't worry.

17:37.480 --> 17:39.400
Take it easy. I will find a way.

17:39.920 --> 17:41.380
I will think of something.

17:52.270 --> 17:56.400
[Wuzhu Courtyard]

17:57.750 --> 17:58.400
Madam,

17:59.070 --> 18:00.600
the one in Liuhua Courtyard

18:00.750 --> 18:01.950
is probably so angry

18:02.070 --> 18:04.200
that she is about to draw her last breath.

18:04.200 --> 18:05.930
If she really doesn't survive,

18:06.480 --> 18:08.140
she only has herself to blame.

18:16.750 --> 18:18.750
She was competitive her whole life.

18:18.960 --> 18:19.790
Even now,

18:21.510 --> 18:23.400
she's still so stubborn.

18:25.680 --> 18:26.110
Madam,

18:26.880 --> 18:28.140
Young Master Zhengjun

18:28.270 --> 18:29.730
is still waiting outside.

18:38.950 --> 18:40.800
[Wuzhu Courtyard]

18:42.680 --> 18:43.880
Second Young Master.

18:44.000 --> 18:44.830
The Head Madam

18:45.510 --> 18:47.270
has been feeling unwell recently.

18:47.270 --> 18:49.480
She just lay down
and hasn't gotten up yet.

18:49.480 --> 18:50.310
Why don't you

18:50.920 --> 18:52.650
come back to visit another day?

18:53.960 --> 18:55.090
I'll just wait here.

19:04.510 --> 19:05.160
Madam.

19:05.880 --> 19:07.410
Young Master Zhengjun said

19:07.920 --> 19:09.590
he'd just wait there.

19:38.110 --> 19:39.000
Forget it.

19:40.790 --> 19:41.790
Let him in.

19:45.920 --> 19:46.640
Head Madam.

19:47.790 --> 19:49.720
I just heard my brother sent a letter.

19:49.720 --> 19:51.030
Could you give me the letter

19:51.030 --> 19:53.290
-so my mother...
-I know why you are here.

19:56.960 --> 19:58.270
But do you know

19:59.200 --> 20:01.960
why I made you kneel
in the rain for so long?

20:05.830 --> 20:07.070
Your brother

20:07.960 --> 20:09.360
went to the battlefield.

20:09.790 --> 20:12.650
You're now the only man in the Xie family.

20:13.000 --> 20:14.070
We have

20:14.350 --> 20:15.680
high hopes for you,

20:15.830 --> 20:18.070
and we hope you can be sensible

20:18.070 --> 20:21.070
and shoulder the responsibilities
of the Xie family.

20:21.070 --> 20:22.160
Your Mother

20:22.640 --> 20:24.240
is a sinner of the Xie family.

20:24.830 --> 20:26.160
According to the rules,

20:28.200 --> 20:30.200
she has no right to read this letter.

20:31.830 --> 20:32.590
So,

20:35.000 --> 20:36.920
I ought to withhold it.

20:39.510 --> 20:41.640
You are absolutely right, Head Madam.

20:42.920 --> 20:45.640
But the bond between my mother
and me runs deep.

20:46.680 --> 20:48.400
I really cannot bear to see her

20:49.240 --> 20:51.000
in such a difficult situation.

20:52.830 --> 20:54.360
Zhengjun, you've grown up.

20:56.160 --> 20:58.030
You know how to care for people now.

20:58.030 --> 20:58.720
Good.

20:59.920 --> 21:00.830
Good.

21:05.590 --> 21:08.000
I know you're a filial and good child.

21:08.640 --> 21:10.550
But you must understand that

21:12.310 --> 21:13.030
she

21:13.880 --> 21:15.720
is currently bearing guilt.

21:15.920 --> 21:17.880
If you blindly get close to her,

21:17.960 --> 21:18.830
I'm afraid

21:19.350 --> 21:21.240
it will displease your father

21:21.960 --> 21:25.310
and affect your bright future.

21:29.790 --> 21:31.030
You and Zhenglun

21:32.110 --> 21:34.200
are now registered under my name.

21:35.720 --> 21:38.270
You're like my own biological sons.

21:39.750 --> 21:40.680
I hope you

21:42.110 --> 21:44.240
understand my intentions.

21:56.440 --> 21:57.400
Perhaps

21:58.480 --> 22:00.070
your older brother's words

22:00.750 --> 22:05.000
will carry some weight with your father.

22:06.680 --> 22:07.750
I understand.

22:09.920 --> 22:11.180
Thank you, Head Madam.

22:27.440 --> 22:28.920
Mother has been locked up.

22:29.640 --> 22:30.640
I heard that soon,

22:31.350 --> 22:33.550
she will be sent to that remote estate.

22:34.830 --> 22:37.960
What should we do now?

22:47.060 --> 22:47.670
[Mother has been locked up.
I heard that soon,]

22:47.690 --> 22:48.300
[she will be sent
to that remote estate.]

22:48.330 --> 22:48.980
[What should we do now?]

22:57.200 --> 22:59.660
Grandmother asked me
to call you for dinner.

23:13.200 --> 23:14.460
No matter the problem,

23:15.480 --> 23:17.590
you must first take care of your health

23:17.590 --> 23:18.990
before thinking of a way.

23:22.240 --> 23:23.100
Fourth Sister.

23:24.030 --> 23:25.560
Do you hate my mother and me?

23:28.480 --> 23:29.480
Those things

23:30.200 --> 23:32.330
were all done by Second Madam herself.

23:32.590 --> 23:34.590
The sins of the parents
don't fall upon their children.

23:34.590 --> 23:36.850
I can still distinguish right from wrong

23:37.000 --> 23:39.060
and won't take my anger out on others.

23:41.440 --> 23:42.200
I'm sorry.

23:46.200 --> 23:48.400
Are you writing a letter to Big Brother?

23:50.550 --> 23:52.550
They're taking my mother to the estate.

23:52.550 --> 23:54.680
Usually, Brother makes the decisions

23:54.880 --> 23:56.280
on all the major matters.

23:58.240 --> 23:59.440
I want to consult him.

23:59.920 --> 24:02.850
But he is already working
very hard at the front line,

24:03.070 --> 24:05.930
so you don't want to bother him
with family matters?

24:09.640 --> 24:10.440
I'll help you.

24:16.880 --> 24:18.640
Everything is fine at home.

24:18.840 --> 24:20.580
[To my dear brother]

24:19.030 --> 24:19.830
Do not worry.

24:22.030 --> 24:24.630
The weather has been
getting colder recently.

24:25.110 --> 24:27.440
I hope you take care of yourself, brother.

24:27.720 --> 24:29.000
Put on more clothes

24:29.680 --> 24:31.110
and stay warm.

24:32.240 --> 24:33.640
Mother and I

24:34.960 --> 24:36.550
miss you very much.

24:36.920 --> 24:38.240
We pray day and night

24:38.510 --> 24:39.750
for your good health.

24:42.350 --> 24:43.410
Everything at home

24:44.030 --> 24:45.310
is the same.

24:46.270 --> 24:48.070
Mother is in good health.

24:48.790 --> 24:51.310
I am studying diligently

24:52.550 --> 24:53.810
without slacking off.

24:54.310 --> 24:55.480
I hope you

24:55.880 --> 24:57.160
can find time

24:57.440 --> 24:59.000
to write us a letter

25:00.350 --> 25:02.270
to ease our longing.

25:05.070 --> 25:06.350
We also pray for

25:07.310 --> 25:08.440
your early triumph

25:09.070 --> 25:10.270
and safe return home.

25:20.930 --> 25:21.690
[I hope you can find time
to write us a letter]

25:21.710 --> 25:22.930
[to ease our longing.]

25:26.110 --> 25:26.950
[Everything is fine at home. Do not worry.
The weather has been getting colder recently.]

25:26.970 --> 25:28.020
[I hope you take care of yourself, brother.
Put on more clothes and stay warm.]

25:30.750 --> 25:31.680
Second Brother.

25:32.240 --> 25:34.030
Please make sure to send a trusted person

25:34.030 --> 25:35.750
to deliver this to Big Brother.

25:35.750 --> 25:37.680
Don't let anyone else handle this.

25:44.440 --> 25:45.300
Fourth Sister.

25:48.720 --> 25:49.510
Thank you.

26:06.970 --> 26:10.680
[Everything is fine at home.
Do not worry.]

26:08.200 --> 26:10.480
Zhengjun has really grown up.

26:10.920 --> 26:13.200
He knows to report only the good news now.

26:16.480 --> 26:18.000
That won't do.

26:32.480 --> 26:33.700
[Your brother, Zhengjun]

26:36.680 --> 26:38.680
Send this to Zhenglun immediately.

26:38.960 --> 26:40.220
It must not be delayed.

26:40.310 --> 26:41.550
Yes, Madam.

26:53.160 --> 26:55.490
The rainy season in Hengtang has arrived.

26:56.160 --> 26:58.200
I wonder how many flowers and plants

26:58.200 --> 26:59.600
won't survive this time.

27:02.830 --> 27:03.640
Make way!

27:03.790 --> 27:05.670
[Dongmen General Store]

27:04.070 --> 27:04.880
Make way!

27:06.640 --> 27:07.510
Make way!

27:09.590 --> 27:10.310
Make way!

27:13.590 --> 27:15.250
-This way, General.
-Report!

27:16.550 --> 27:17.110
Please.

27:17.550 --> 27:19.790
To the family of General Xie Zhenglun,

27:19.790 --> 27:21.030
Vanguard General

27:21.240 --> 27:22.300
of the Ningwu Army.

27:22.830 --> 27:24.680
Since the flames of war
ignited at the border,

27:24.680 --> 27:25.510
your son Zhenglun,

27:25.510 --> 27:26.550
loyal and courageous,

27:26.550 --> 27:27.590
rose up

27:27.640 --> 27:28.960
and requested to fight.

27:28.960 --> 27:30.750
He left his home to face the crisis.

27:30.750 --> 27:32.400
He was besieged in an isolated city.

27:32.400 --> 27:33.440
The city fell,

27:34.350 --> 27:35.200
and to protect the people,

27:35.200 --> 27:36.400
he was pierced by countless arrows.

27:36.400 --> 27:38.200
His sacrifice cannot be repaid.

27:38.550 --> 27:39.440
In his final moments,

27:39.440 --> 27:40.830
his mind was still clear.

27:40.830 --> 27:43.030
He remembered
your deep grace in raising him,

27:43.030 --> 27:45.160
and regretted that he could not
return to care for you.

27:45.160 --> 27:46.350
His words were choked with sobs,

27:46.350 --> 27:48.410
and everyone who heard him was moved.

27:48.440 --> 27:49.920
His loyal and courageous act

27:49.920 --> 27:51.030
and his awe-inspiring heroism

27:51.030 --> 27:52.480
are enough to be a model
for the whole army,

27:52.480 --> 27:53.680
and admired by future generations.

27:53.680 --> 27:54.810
I sincerely hope you

27:55.310 --> 27:56.880
and your family will restrain your grief

27:56.880 --> 27:58.480
and take care of yourselves.

27:58.680 --> 28:00.200
His heroic deeds

28:00.240 --> 28:01.750
will surely go down in history

28:01.750 --> 28:03.240
and be remembered forever.

28:03.240 --> 28:05.200
April 20th, 8th year of Jingxi.

28:05.480 --> 28:07.340
Delivered by urgent horse relay.

28:08.880 --> 28:11.310
Zhenglun!

28:16.400 --> 28:18.750
My grandson!

28:20.550 --> 28:24.240
How could you bear
to let an elderly like me

28:24.240 --> 28:28.000
bury a young man like you?

28:33.240 --> 28:34.170
Mother! Mother!

28:35.200 --> 28:37.350
Mother, please restrain your grief.

28:38.110 --> 28:39.920
My son!

29:06.790 --> 29:08.060
Second Brother.

29:08.160 --> 29:09.680
About the letter you sent that day,

29:09.680 --> 29:10.550
are you sure

29:10.640 --> 29:12.310
it didn't pass through
anyone else's hands?

29:12.310 --> 29:13.880
I don't know what to do.

29:15.030 --> 29:17.090
I can't care about anything else now.

29:18.240 --> 29:19.480
My brother is gone.

29:20.960 --> 29:21.920
What should I do?

29:23.270 --> 29:25.000
What will happen to Mother now?

29:25.720 --> 29:28.000
He was fine the last time he wrote.

29:32.310 --> 29:33.240
My condolences.

29:34.270 --> 29:36.550
But this matter is of great importance.

29:37.070 --> 29:39.200
Second Brother, please think it over.

29:39.920 --> 29:41.160
Here you are.

29:51.830 --> 29:52.430
Qingyuan.

29:55.400 --> 29:56.350
Come with me.

30:09.830 --> 30:10.880
Recently,

30:11.960 --> 30:14.160
much has happened in the household,

30:15.200 --> 30:17.600
with Zhenglun's passing being a huge blow.

30:20.480 --> 30:21.880
After mulling it over,

30:22.750 --> 30:23.830
in this family,

30:24.920 --> 30:25.980
I only feel assured

30:26.480 --> 30:28.210
entrusting this matter to you.

30:29.030 --> 30:30.160
Whatever you order,

30:30.590 --> 30:31.920
as far as I'm capable,

30:32.200 --> 30:33.800
I will definitely do my best.

30:47.520 --> 30:49.550
[Respectfully to Madam Mei
of the Xie family in Hengtang]

30:53.030 --> 30:54.440
This is the letter Zhenglun

30:54.440 --> 30:55.960
wrote to Concubine Mei.

30:56.240 --> 30:58.000
Concubine Mei is a sinner,

30:58.240 --> 31:00.480
and I was afraid
she'd cause more trouble,

31:00.480 --> 31:01.920
so I held onto it.

31:03.000 --> 31:04.000
Concubine Mei

31:04.680 --> 31:06.440
killed your biological mother.

31:06.440 --> 31:09.400
She also paid the price she deserved.

31:10.240 --> 31:11.550
But no matter what,

31:13.270 --> 31:15.400
she is Zhenglun's biological mother.

31:15.720 --> 31:17.580
Respect for the dead comes first.

31:17.960 --> 31:21.480
This letter can be considered
Zhenglun's last words.

31:22.960 --> 31:24.310
Take this letter

31:25.000 --> 31:26.330
along with the obituary

31:26.480 --> 31:28.210
and give them to Concubine Mei.

31:28.830 --> 31:29.640
If you can,

31:31.550 --> 31:33.920
comfort her with a few words.

31:35.750 --> 31:36.350
Yes.

31:47.750 --> 31:48.880
If you don't finish washing

31:48.880 --> 31:50.080
these clothes today,

31:51.960 --> 31:53.310
you're not allowed to eat tonight.

31:53.310 --> 31:55.170
You'll be locked in the woodshed!

31:56.110 --> 31:57.770
She's not asking me to deliver

31:58.000 --> 31:59.090
a letter today.

31:59.750 --> 32:01.400
It's clearly the last straw

32:01.830 --> 32:04.200
that will break Mei Yinghua.

32:09.920 --> 32:10.590
Nanny Qin.

32:12.830 --> 32:13.560
Fourth Lady,

32:13.720 --> 32:14.750
why are you here?

32:15.200 --> 32:16.860
I have to talk to Second Madam.

32:31.270 --> 32:33.240
Mother, on the day of my departure,

32:33.400 --> 32:35.110
I was unable
to bid you farewell in person.

32:35.110 --> 32:36.440
I feel quite regretful.

32:36.720 --> 32:37.930
I wonder if Zhengjun

32:38.160 --> 32:40.020
is taking good care of you at home.

32:40.830 --> 32:41.960
I miss you very much.

32:42.640 --> 32:44.350
After all, you are the mother

32:44.350 --> 32:46.550
who has cherished me since I was little.

32:46.940 --> 32:47.810
Mother.

32:48.060 --> 32:49.790
When I'm done with my work here,

32:50.000 --> 32:51.720
I'll go home and accompany you.

32:51.720 --> 32:52.880
Whether you want to chant sutras

32:52.880 --> 32:53.940
or go to the estate,

32:54.510 --> 32:56.790
I'll be there with you, alright?

32:58.590 --> 33:00.120
As long as my son, Zhenglun,

33:00.440 --> 33:01.480
is doing well,

33:03.880 --> 33:05.270
I am assured.

33:07.000 --> 33:07.920
Qingyuan.

33:09.310 --> 33:10.510
Thank you.

33:24.350 --> 33:25.680
Is there anything else?

33:30.720 --> 33:36.410
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

33:36.470 --> 33:42.540
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

33:40.070 --> 33:41.560
[Eighth year of Jingxi,
Emergency Delivery from the Privy Council]

33:42.610 --> 33:47.900
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

33:46.680 --> 33:48.550
My son, Zhenglun!

33:47.960 --> 33:54.020
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

33:54.090 --> 34:00.280
♪ Pear blossoms drift through the courtyard,
fluttering like snowflakes in a song ♪

34:00.310 --> 34:06.570
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

34:06.660 --> 34:12.949
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

34:12.980 --> 34:18.880
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

34:16.840 --> 34:17.670
Zhenglun...

34:18.900 --> 34:25.070
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

34:20.800 --> 34:24.670
I wasn't the only one
who harmed Fifth Madam.

34:25.090 --> 34:31.190
♪ I wonder,
is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

34:28.590 --> 34:31.630
You shouldn't have taken the blame!

34:31.210 --> 34:37.429
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
of life and death ♪

34:37.449 --> 34:43.389
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

35:01.280 --> 35:02.440
Zhenglun...

35:11.400 --> 35:11.920
Mother!

35:12.220 --> 35:17.740
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

35:13.280 --> 35:14.110
Zhenglun?

35:15.550 --> 35:16.630
Zhenglun...

35:17.770 --> 35:23.570
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

35:19.070 --> 35:19.840
Hurry.

35:23.070 --> 35:24.070
Come home to me.

35:23.910 --> 35:29.260
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

35:28.320 --> 35:29.360
Come here.

35:29.350 --> 35:35.420
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

35:34.280 --> 35:35.110
Hurry.

35:35.660 --> 35:41.520
♪ Pear blossoms drift through the courtyard,
fluttering like snowflakes in a song ♪

35:41.000 --> 35:41.670
And you.

35:41.670 --> 35:42.670
I told you

35:41.680 --> 35:47.820
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

35:43.190 --> 35:44.320
to pick this flower.

35:45.110 --> 35:45.910
Go over there.

35:47.440 --> 35:48.480
Take that flowerpot away.

35:47.890 --> 35:54.250
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

35:48.480 --> 35:49.190
Toss it.

35:52.190 --> 35:52.960
Clean this up.

35:52.960 --> 35:54.320
Third Madam is kind-hearted.

35:54.270 --> 36:00.310
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

35:54.590 --> 35:55.880
After how Concubine Mei treated her,

35:55.880 --> 35:57.150
she still took the trouble to send people

35:57.150 --> 35:59.610
to deliver all her belongings
to the estate.

36:00.150 --> 36:02.760
Concubine Mei used to be
the most arrogant and domineering.

36:00.340 --> 36:06.280
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

36:02.760 --> 36:04.800
She always had to be
the best at everything.

36:04.800 --> 36:08.030
Who would have thought
she'd end up a lunatic?

36:06.300 --> 36:13.110
♪ I wonder,
is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

36:09.630 --> 36:10.830
Sometimes, going mad

36:11.280 --> 36:12.480
is also a relief.

36:13.130 --> 36:19.060
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
of life and death ♪

36:13.190 --> 36:14.280
Hurry up.

36:14.840 --> 36:16.630
I haven't seen
Third Madam for a long time.

36:16.630 --> 36:18.230
I'm going to Hanxiang Parlor.

36:18.230 --> 36:19.180
You go back first.

36:19.180 --> 36:24.790
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

36:19.550 --> 36:20.280
Yes.

36:25.430 --> 36:33.750
♪ No more wandering and worrying ♪

36:29.320 --> 36:31.710
The young master is in mourning
for his mother,

36:31.710 --> 36:33.970
and with your eldest brother's passing,

36:34.440 --> 36:36.880
your eldest sister
is in an even worse mood.

36:38.760 --> 36:40.620
Fortunately, with your support,

36:41.030 --> 36:42.190
the herbal shop

36:42.320 --> 36:43.920
is able to operate normally.

36:47.630 --> 36:49.320
Eldest Sister and the Young Lord

36:49.320 --> 36:50.550
are deeply in love.

36:50.880 --> 36:53.590
They can't marry because of
the mourning period,

36:53.590 --> 36:54.790
which is truly a pity.

36:55.630 --> 36:56.960
We rise

36:56.960 --> 36:58.150
and fall together.

36:58.670 --> 37:00.470
Born into this noble household,

37:01.000 --> 37:02.190
we are destined

37:02.400 --> 37:04.670
to share its honor and disgrace.

37:05.760 --> 37:07.760
Who could ever remain untainted?

37:11.510 --> 37:13.480
So did you purge the ranks...

37:15.800 --> 37:18.000
also to keep the peace in the Xie family?

37:21.960 --> 37:23.490
What are you talking about?

37:24.000 --> 37:25.320
I don't understand.

37:54.920 --> 37:56.110
You knew

37:56.800 --> 37:58.460
Concubine Mei loved flowers,

37:58.800 --> 38:00.130
so you poisoned the soil

38:00.590 --> 38:02.280
and drove her insane.

38:06.480 --> 38:07.150
Right?

38:10.670 --> 38:13.070
Second Madam killed Chunqing.

38:13.710 --> 38:16.630
I was just avenging her.

38:20.590 --> 38:21.550
Third Madam.

38:22.400 --> 38:24.400
If you wanted to avenge my mother,

38:25.590 --> 38:27.990
you could have used
this poison 9 years ago.

38:28.360 --> 38:30.710
But why did you have to wait till today?

38:31.280 --> 38:33.670
Isn't it because the mastermind

38:34.590 --> 38:36.390
only gave you permission today?

38:44.760 --> 38:46.030
That day, you publicly

38:46.320 --> 38:47.360
testified for me

38:47.710 --> 38:50.040
not because Qinghe persuaded you, right?

38:50.480 --> 38:52.710
It was because the mastermind

38:53.510 --> 38:54.760
instructed you to.

38:55.960 --> 38:56.550
Right?

39:00.320 --> 39:01.190
This person

39:03.190 --> 39:04.450
is First Madam, right?

39:41.280 --> 39:42.540
Who would have thought

39:44.280 --> 39:46.510
that the much-wronged Head Madam

39:48.000 --> 39:50.480
would be the mastermind behind all this?

39:56.670 --> 39:58.440
It's my fault.

39:59.670 --> 40:00.920
I'm the one

40:02.550 --> 40:04.110
who harmed Chunqing

40:06.030 --> 40:07.480
and Fifth Madam.

40:08.230 --> 40:10.480
She threatened me with that

40:10.880 --> 40:12.590
and made me do her bidding.

40:13.440 --> 40:14.760
It was me.

40:18.590 --> 40:19.710
It was me.

40:20.510 --> 40:23.510
Because I could no longer bear
Second Madam's disdain

40:23.920 --> 40:25.110
and oppression,

40:25.760 --> 40:27.550
I told First Madam

40:27.920 --> 40:30.450
the secret that euphorbia
and Congxian Grass

40:30.840 --> 40:32.920
are lethal when taken together.

40:33.710 --> 40:35.440
But I really didn't expect that

40:35.630 --> 40:37.360
the one who got harmed in the end

40:38.280 --> 40:39.920
would be Chunqing.

40:46.190 --> 40:47.790
I lived in seclusion because

40:48.920 --> 40:51.920
I didn't want to get involved
in their fights anymore.

40:52.190 --> 40:55.120
I didn't want to be involved
in their crimes anymore.

40:56.150 --> 40:57.480
But this time...

40:58.360 --> 41:00.550
Although I was instigated by her,

41:01.360 --> 41:03.880
I really wanted to avenge Chunqing,

41:04.190 --> 41:05.590
so I fulfilled her wish!

41:09.840 --> 41:10.570
Third Madam.

41:12.960 --> 41:13.890
I don't hate you.

41:15.150 --> 41:16.280
What I hate is,

41:17.510 --> 41:18.840
why is it that every time

41:20.110 --> 41:23.110
the ones who bear the consequences
of these struggles

41:25.590 --> 41:27.120
are always innocent people

41:27.800 --> 41:29.860
like my mother and my eldest brother?

41:35.440 --> 41:36.230
Child.

41:38.230 --> 41:39.490
You don't understand.

41:40.070 --> 41:42.600
If the wind in this world
never stops blowing,

41:44.150 --> 41:45.670
the trees in this world

41:46.480 --> 41:48.030
will never stop swaying.

41:48.670 --> 41:50.440
One Concubine Mei has gone mad,

41:52.880 --> 41:55.960
but there will be another.

42:06.000 --> 42:06.760
Qingyuan!
